flowchart LR
    START([START]) --> query_planner[Query Planner]
    query_planner --> retriever[Retriever SQL]
    retriever --> classifier[Classifier]
    classifier --> recommender[Recommender + RAG híbrido]
    recommender --> validator[Evidence Validator]
    validator -->|alerta e tentativa < 2| recommender
    validator -->|válido ou segunda falha| briefing[Briefing Agent]
    briefing --> END([END])
